*.html
# ...except the workbench's own pages, which are SOURCE: it #loads them into the exe. quiz-template.html is
# vendored from bridge-system-apps (`just dswasm vendor-template` there), so a fresh clone builds.
!deal-simulations/odin-sims/ui/*.html
html/
deal-simulations/parse-deal
